# Density Compare
# Iodine (I) — real density 4.93 g/cm³. equal masses: Iodine vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Iodine Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 11.7mm color: #940094 at (-20mm, 5.9mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 39.3 g — the water cube is the reference
